    Add multi-turn Q&A conversation history
    
    - Question panel shows the whole conversation as a threaded log: user and
      assistant bubbles, readable timestamps, confidence, and each answer's
      citations (document, chunk, excerpt). Clicking a citation opens the document
    - Follow-up questions are linked to their parent exchange, and the service adds
      the parent question to the retrieval context
    - Copy answer, expandable long answers, collapsible sources, clear conversation
      with inline confirmation, pending state, and inline error with retry
    - Sidebar History lists past questions and jumps to the selected exchange
    - QaService persists id/askedAt/followUpOf and normalizes legacy entries via
      getConversation(), served on conversation:get. Excerpts end on a word boundary
    - Accessibility: role=log thread, articles with question headings, <time>,
      labelled input, aria-expanded toggles, focus-visible styles
    - Tests: tests/qa-conversation.test.ts (vitest). E2E:
      scripts/verify-conversation.mjs (23/23 in the running app), evidence in
      docs/verification/

